    "title": "Career Opportunity Real Estate Agent at Nexus Malls Global Group",
    "description": "Nexus Malls Global Group, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Real Estate Agent for our Indore operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout Nexus Malls Global Group:\nNexus Malls Global Group is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage RERA documentation and compliance requirements\n• Conduct land acquisition due diligence and feasibility studies\n• Conduct market research and provide competitive analysis\n• Coordinate with architects, contractors, and project teams\n• Negotiate pricing, terms, and conditions on behalf of clients\n• Liaise with banks and NBFCs for home loan assistance to customers\n• Maintain a pipeline of qualified leads using CRM software\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in RERA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Market Research\n• Proficiency in Title Search\n• Proficiency in Property Management\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Investment Analysis\n• Proficiency in Sales Techniques\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Nexus Malls Global Group!",
